    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>👩‍💻 Biography</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
        Hello! I am </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;b&gt;</span><span>Lalitha Sri Geddada</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/b&gt;</span><span>, a B.Tech student in 
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;b&gt;</span><span>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/b&gt;</span><span> at 
        </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;b&gt;</span><span>Sri Vasavi Engineering College, Tadepalligudem</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/b&gt;</span><span>.
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
        I am interested in software development, web development, and artificial intelligence.
        I enjoy building projects, learning new technologies, and improving my programming skills.
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;img</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">src</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"about1.jpg"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">width</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"300"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">height</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"200"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">alt</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"About Image"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;hr</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">color</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"darkblue"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>🎯 Career Objective</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
        To get an opportunity in the software industry where I can apply my programming skills,
        learn new technologies, and grow as a software developer while contributing to real-time projects.
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

