    &lt;/nav&gt;
    &lt;hr&gt;
   &lt;h2&gt;👩‍💻 Biography&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Hello! I am &lt;b&gt;Lalitha Sri Geddada&lt;/b&gt;, a B.Tech student in 
        &lt;b&gt;Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning&lt;/b&gt; at 
        &lt;b&gt;Sri Vasavi Engineering College, Tadepalligudem&lt;/b&gt;.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;
        I am interested in software development, web development, and artificial intelligence.
        I enjoy building projects, learning new technologies, and improving my programming skills.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;img src="assets.jpg/bio.jpg" width="300" height="200" alt="About Image"&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;🎯 Career Objective&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        To get an opportunity in the software industry where I can apply my programming skills,
        learn new technologies, and grow as a software developer while contributing to real-time projects.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;💡 My Interests&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Full Stack Development&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Artificial Intelligence&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Machine Learning&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Web Development&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;img src="coding.jpg" width="300" height="200" alt="Coding Image"&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;❤️ Hobbies&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;📘 Reading technology blogs&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;💻 Coding personal projects&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;🌱 Learning new technologies&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;🤝 Working with teams&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;🌟 My Strengths&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Quick learner&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Positive attitude&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Team player&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Good communication skills&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Creative thinking&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Self motivated&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Time management&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2 align="center"&gt;🚀 My Journey&lt;/h2&gt;
    
        &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2022&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Started B.Tech in AIML&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;↓&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2024&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Completed Full Stack Internship at BlackBucks&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;↓&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2025&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Completed AI/ML Java Full Stack Internship at LearnSquare&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;↓&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2026&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Preparing for Software Developer Career&lt;/p&gt;
    

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2 align="center"&gt;🖥️ Favorite Technologies&lt;/h2&gt;
    
        &lt;table cellpadding="15"&gt;
            &lt;tr&gt;
                &lt;td align="center"&gt;Python&lt;/td&gt;
                &lt;td align="center"&gt;HTML&lt;/td&gt;
                &lt;td align="center"&gt;CSS&lt;/td&gt;
                &lt;td align="center"&gt;JavaScript&lt;/td&gt;
                &lt;td align="center"&gt;MySQL&lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;/table&gt;
    

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;📚 Education&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;B.Tech AIML&lt;/b&gt; - Sri Vasavi Engineering College, Tadepalligudem&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Intermediate MPC&lt;/b&gt; - Aditya Junior College, Palakol&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Schooling&lt;/b&gt; - Sri Chaitanya E.M High School, Palakol&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;📌 Projects&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hybrid Quantum CNN for MRI based Brain Tumor Detection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Developed a Hybrid Quantum-Classical CNN using PennyLane and TensorFlow
        for brain tumor detection.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fertilizer Recommendation System&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Developed a machine learning system to recommend suitable fertilizers
        based on soil and environmental data.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Recipe Sharing Platform&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        Built a platform where users can search, share, like, and discover recipes.
    &lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;🏆 Certifications&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ SAP Certified Associate - Back-End Developer ABAP Cloud&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Oracle Certified AI Foundations Associate&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ Microsoft Azure AI Fundamentals&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;✓ EF SET Certification - B2 Level&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;🎉 Fun Facts About Me&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;💡 I enjoy turning ideas into real projects.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;📌 Every project teaches me something new.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;🌱 Learning is my favorite daily habit.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;⭐ I believe small improvements create big success.&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;🌈 Motto&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;"Learning never stops."&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;"Every line of code makes me better."&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

    &lt;h2&gt;📌 Personal Information&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Name:&lt;/b&gt; Lalitha Sri Geddada&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;College:&lt;/b&gt; Sri Vasavi Engineering College&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Branch:&lt;/b&gt; Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Languages:&lt;/b&gt; English, Telugu, Hindi&lt;/p&gt;

    &lt;hr color="darkblue"&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;&amp;copy; 2026 Lalitha Sri Geddada&lt;/p&gt;
