 \\\"probably not ideal,\\\" \\\"good budget option,\\\" \\\"seriously may be a fit,\\\" etc.)\\n\\nGuidelines:\\n- Be honest and practical.\\n- Do not blindly promote the ad.\\n- Avoid harsh or absolute negative language.\\n- Do not invent details not present in the ad.\\n- Focus on fit, not feature lists.\\n- If the mark on relevance is clearly missed, feel free to be funny with it and keep it lighthearted. Do not mock the user or advertiser; keep the humor gentle.\\n\\nKeep it concise, direct, and easy to scan.\\n\\n{conversation}\",\"enable_web_search\":false,\"user_prompt_key\":\"good_option\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"3203804112\":{\"name\":\"3203804112\",\"rule_id\":\"l1cQu29IviknlZ0BNwTdR\",\"secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"1744743680\",\"gateValue\":\"true\",\"ruleID\":\"3nVjDtIaNJ2nyoZuftIzj0\"}],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"upload_photos\":false},\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"Control\",\"is_experiment_active\":true,\"is_user_in_experiment\":true},\"635008376\":{\"name\":\"635008376\",\"rule_id\":\"6laclntZ4wWJwvp6ltSlKV-6lacllOWCeNfd5RaKlWIrT\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"show_see_all_plans_button\":\"\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":true},\"3747383021\":{\"name\":\"3747383021\",\"rule_id\":\"7cvBu4nR7a9tVSNBIeCzCV:100.00:1\",\"secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"3014785993\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"6AjlvCYVxZabCc6WnfIYHt\"},{\"gate\":\"3737660407\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"3720285278\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"733205176\",\"gateValue\":\"true\",\"ruleID\":\"64zSpYdNz3zRgulUhRHj86:100.00:13\"}],\"id_type\":\"stableID\",\"value\":{\"hubspot\":true,\"slack\":true,\"outlook_email\":true,\"google_calendar\":true,\"linear\":true,\"dropbox\":true,\"outlook_calendar\":true,\"canva\":true,\"notion\":true,\"mcp\":true,\"teams\":true,\"gmail\":true,\"google_drive\":true,\"github\":true,\"box\":true,