reate a simple train ticket status flowchart with icons for CNF, RAC, WL and Tatkal. Keep labels short and editable.\"},{\"title\":\"Build a reading routine\",\"body\":\"Help me build a 20-minute reading routine. Ask me one question about when I can read, then suggest a first-week plan.\"},{\"title\":\"Learn to plan a short trip\",\"body\":\"Teach me how to plan a short trip from scratch. Ask one question about destination and dates, then build a simple itinerary outline.\"},{\"title\":\"Get into Wimbledon gently\",\"body\":\"Give me a fun Wimbledon 2026 primer: what makes grass-court tennis different, who to notice, and how to sound less lost.\"},{\"title\":\"Pick a Wimbledon match\",\"body\":\"Check the current Wimbledon schedule and suggest one match to follow from India, with the likely match time and one story to watch.\"},{\"body\":\"I need to send a tricky WhatsApp message. Ask me to paste it and say who it is for, then make it polite and natural.\",\"title\":\"Polish a WhatsApp message\"},{\"title\":\"Turn revision into a game\",\"body\":\"Make my unit-test revision feel like a game. Ask my subject first, then give a 20-minute plan with quick rounds.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a rainproof commute\",\"body\":\"Make a rainy-day commute game plan. Ask my city and route first, then suggest backup transport, timing buffers and what to pack.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a cricket catch-up card\",\"body\":\"Give me a fun, no-jargon catch-up on the Women’s T20 World Cup, with India’s path, key players to notice, and one thing to watch today.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a late-night cricket watch\",\"body\":\"Build a light India vs England watch plan for July: match reminders, snack breaks, and a simple way to follow if I miss overs.\"},{\"title\":\"Build a kirana restock list\",\"body\":\"Make a monthly kirana restock list. Ask my household size first, then organise staples, cleaning items and quick top-ups.\"},{\"title\":\"Read monsoon updates better\",\"body\":\"Explain today’s India monsoon update in plain English, including what normal, deficit and warning colours mean.\"},{\"title\":\"Build a monsoon travel buffer\",\"body\":\"Help me plan a monsoon journey with buffers for delays. Ask my city pair and travel mode, then make a practical backup plan.\"},{\"body\":\"Make a spoiler-free debate guide for a current Indian film my friends have seen. Ask the film name, then give talking points.\",\"title\":\"Host a spoiler-free film chat\"},{\"title\":\"Plan your Wimbledon viewing\",\"body\":\"Check the Wimbledon 2026 schedule and make me a simple IST viewing plan for the first week. Ask which players I care about.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a study quest map\",\"body\":\"Create a simple study quest map with 7 checkpoints, icons and blank labels. Ask me the subject first, then give label text separately.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a pantry check poster\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light pantry label-check poster with icons for MRP, expiry, ingredients, veg or non-veg symbol and storage.\"},{\"title\":\"Draw a rainy entryway\",\"body\":\"Create a simple text-light rainy entryway layout for an Indian flat: shoe zone, umbrella spot, drying mat and hooks. No brand names.\"},{\"title\":\"Get documents ready online\",\"body\":\"Help me prepare a DigiLocker-ready document set for admissions or a government service. Ask which task first.\"},{\"body\":\"Make a monsoon laundry rota for a small home where clothes dry indoors. Include smell prevention, rainy-day backup and what to wash first.\",\"title\":\"Fix monsoon laundry\"},{\"title\":\"Prepare Passport Seva papers\",\"body\":\"Help me prepare for a Passport Seva appointment. Check official document guidance and ask one question about my application type.\"},{\"body\":\"Explain DigiLocker in everyday terms and help me plan which documents to fetch, upload, or carry as originals.\",\"title\":\"Set up DigiLocker basics\"},{\"title\":\"Learn ride phrases\",\"body\":\"Teach me 8 polite phrases for an auto or cab ride. Ask my city or language first, then give pronunciation help.\"},{\"body\":\"Practise a 5-minute small-talk scene with me. Ask the setting first, then play the other person and keep it light.\",\"title\":\"Practise small talk lightly\"},{\"body\":\"Teach me a difficult topic using everyday examples. Ask me the topic first, then build a 10-minute lesson.\",\"title\":\"Learn a topic with examples\"},{\"title\":\"Pack a better tiffin\",\"body\":\"Plan 3 spill-proof tiffin ideas. Ask what I eat and whether I can reheat first, then keep it practical.\"},{\"title\":\"Pack for hostel in the rains\",\"body\":\"Make a first hostel packing list for India’s monsoon months. Ask my city and hostel rules first, then group must-haves and nice-to-haves.\"},{\"title\":\"Review UPI AutoPay safely\",\"body\":\"Teach me how UPI AutoPay mandates work and give me a safe way to review subscriptions without sharing account details.\"},{\"body\":\"Practise a short meeting update with me. Give me a simple structure, then ask one question and correct my answer gently.\",\"title\":\"Practise a meeting update\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light packing map for a monsoon hostel or PG room: bedding, documents, footwear, laundry and desk. Use simple icons.\",\"title\":\"Draw a hostel packing map\"},{\"title\":\"Rain-proof my day\",\"body\":\"Help me make a practical monsoon plan for today: commute, footwear, laundry and bag essentials. Ask for my city first.\"},{\"title\":\"Understand the new India names\",\"body\":\"Explain the young players people are discussing in India’s Ireland and England T20Is. Keep it beginner-friendly and avoid hype.\"},{\"title\":\"Share a UPI split politely\",\"body\":\"Write a clear, polite message to request a UPI split for a group expense. Keep it short and include a line asking people to verify payee name.\"},{\"body\":\"Make me a simple FIFA World Cup watch plan for India time. Ask which teams I follow, then suggest matches, snacks and a sleep-friendly routine.\",\"title\":\"Plan a World Cup night\"},{\"title\":\"Create a chore wheel\",\"body\":\"Create a simple chore wheel with household task icons and blank name spaces. Ask how many people should fit on it first.\"},{\"body\":\"Build a monsoon commute kit for my city and travel mode. Ask one question if needed, then group items as must-carry and optional.\",\"title\":\"Pack for monsoon commutes\"},{\"body\":\"Use current India music charts to build a 7-song playlist theme for a rainy commute. Avoid explicit lyrics unless I ask.\",\"title\":\"Build a rainy commute playlist\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light match-night scoreboard image for the Women’s T20 World Cup. Keep spaces blank for teams, runs, snacks, and MVP.\",\"title\":\"Create a match-night scoreboard\"},{\"title\":\"Build a smarter grocery run\",\"body\":\"Make a grocery list that prevents random extras. Ask what I’m cooking this week, then group items by store section.\"},{\"body\":\"I’ll paste only my ticket status, not my full PNR. Explain CNF, RAC or WL and tell me the next sensible check.\",\"title\":\"Decode my train status\"},{\"body\":\"Help me turn fridge leftovers into an Indian-style meal. I can upload a photo or list what I have.\",\"title\":\"Cook from fridge leftovers\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a short trip in India\",\"body\":\"Help plan a 2–3 day trip in India. First ask my starting city and rough budget, then suggest practical options.\"},{\"title\":\"Break down a charting song\",\"body\":\"Pick a song currently high on YouTube India and explain its hook, structure and replay value without quoting lyrics.\"},{\"body\":\"Teach me pressure cooker basics for dal, rice and chana, including whistles, soaking and safety checks.\",\"title\":\"Learn cooker timing basics\"},{\"title\":\"Storyboard a song hook\",\"body\":\"Create a 6-frame, text-light storyboard template for explaining why a current YouTube India song hook works, with no lyrics or artist likenesses.\"},{\"body\":\"Give me a 30-minute game plan to sort household papers into keep, act and file piles. Ask what kind of papers I have first.\",\"title\":\"Sort papers without panic\"},{\"title\":\"Pick a Van Mahotsav sapling\",\"body\":\"Help me pick one low-maintenance native sapling for Van Mahotsav. Ask my city and planting space, then give care steps.\"},{\"body\":\"Explain the FIFA World Cup knockout format for an India viewer, including how extra time and penalties work.\",\"title\":\"Learn the World Cup knockout\"},{\"title\":\"Make a match-night tracker\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light FIFA World Cup match-night tracker with blank team slots, score spaces, and room for IST timings.\"},{\"body\":\"Give me a quick profile of a current India squad pick being searched a lot. Cover role, recent context and what to watch for.\",\"title\":\"Decode a talked-about squad pick\"},{\"title\":\"Play mock interview ping-pong\",\"body\":\"Run a mock interview like ping-pong. Ask my role, then give one question at a time with a short coaching note after each answer.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a tiffin rotation\",\"body\":\"Build a 5-day school or office tiffin rotation using Indian staples. Ask one question about dietary limits before suggesting.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple T20 fielding map for a new cricket fan using dots and zones, with any position names listed outside the image.\",\"title\":\"See field positions clearly\"},{\"title\":\"Understand Form 16 and AIS\",\"body\":\"Explain Form 16, AIS, 26AS and ITR in simple terms for AY 2026-27. Ask one question only if you need my income type.\"},{\"body\":\"Help me make a tiny-payment routine for chai, autos and kirana. Check current UPI Lite rules and remind me not to share PINs.\",\"title\":\"Sort tiny UPI payments\"},{\"body\":\"Explain gazetted, restricted and state holidays in India using the 2026 calendar. Give a simple rule for checking office or school closures.\",\"title\":\"Decode holiday types\"},{\"body\":\"Turn weekly chores into a fair, playful rota. Ask how many people are sharing, then suggest roles, swaps and a 10-minute reset.\",\"title\":\"Make chores less boring\"},{\"title\":\"Create a rainy-day snack board\",\"body\":\"Create a cosy, text-light image of an Indian monsoon snack board with chai, rain cues and blank label spaces.\"},{\"title\":\"Choose an OTT trailer night\",\"body\":\"Find three current India OTT trailers worth sampling tonight, then make a playful 30-minute no-spoiler watch plan.\"},{\"body\":\"Make a tiny Wimbledon bracket game I can use with friends, simple scoring, no expert knowledge needed.\",\"title\":\"Make a mini tennis bracket\"},{\"body\":\"Help me turn leftovers into dinner. Ask me for a fridge photo or ingredient list, then suggest 3 playful options with simple steps.\",\"title\":\"Remix leftovers into dinner\"},{\"title\":\"Make a tiffin idea wheel\",\"body\":\"Create a simple tiffin idea wheel with icons for grain, protein, veg, fruit and snack. Use blank labels, no brand names.\"},{\"body\":\"Help me discuss Kargil Vijay Diwas in a balanced way for a study group. Give 5 questions that focus on history, courage and evidence.\",\"title\":\"Discuss Kargil respectfully\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light Wimbledon bingo card image for a home watch. Use simple icons and blank squares, no player likenesses or logos.\",\"title\":\"Create a tennis bingo card\"},{\"title\":\"Sketch a better room layout\",\"body\":\"Create a simple layout sketch to make my desk or room easier to use. Ask for a photo or short description first.\"},{\"title\":\"Host a mango tasting\",\"body\":\"Suggest a playful mango tasting at home for National Mango Day. Include ways to compare flavour, texture, aroma and use.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a clean, text-light tennis scorecard image for Wimbledon watching. Leave blanks for player names and sets. No logos.\",\"title\":\"Make a tennis score card\"},{\"title\":\"Make a rainy commute card\",\"body\":\"Create a simple rainy-day commute safety card for India, using icons only and no location-specific claims.\"},{\"title\":\"Create a Reel storyboard\",\"body\":\"Create a simple 6-panel image storyboard for a 20-second everyday Reel. Keep it text-light and use blank caption boxes.\"},{\"title\":\"Reset my desk like a game\",\"body\":\"Help me reset my desk in 15 minutes. Ask me for a photo or short description, then turn it into 3 quick rounds.\"},{\"title\":\"Settle a UPI split politely\",\"body\":\"Help me write a polite message to split a UPI payment. Ask what was paid and the amount, then make it clear without sounding awkward.\"},{\"title\":\"Understand Rath Yatra quickly\",\"body\":\"Give me a friendly 5-minute guide to Puri Rath Yatra, including key words I’ll hear and respectful visitor basics.\"},{\"body\":\"Make a simple IST watch plan for the next FIFA World Cup 2026 matches I care about. Ask which teams I follow, then keep it realistic for workdays.\",\"title\":\"Plan a late-night World Cup watch\"},{\"title\":\"Design a drying corner\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light visual layout for a monsoon drying corner at home. Ask one question about space if needed.\"},{\"title\":\"Fix my match stream setup\",\"body\":\"Help me choose a reliable live-sport setup for home: TV, app or backup data. Ask what I’m watching and what devices I have.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple text-light illustration of Puri Rath Yatra’s temple-to-Gundicha journey, with blank labels I can fill in.\",\"title\":\"Create a Rath Yatra story map\"},{\"body\":\"Practise an interview for my role. Ask one question at a time, wait for my answer, then give brief feedback. First ask my role.\",\"title\":\"Practise interview answers\"},{\"title\":\"Write a service message\",\"body\":\"Help me write a short message to a driver, shop or technician in English and one Indian language I choose. Ask the language first.\"},{\"title\":\"Pick a cinema plan\",\"body\":\"Help me choose from current Hindi and pan-India theatrical releases. Ask my city and mood, then make a simple cinema plan.\"},{\"title\":\"Learn BGMI lag terms\",\"body\":\"Explain BGMI terms like ping, desync, FPS and server lag with simple examples a casual player would get.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light World Cup match tracker image I can print. Use blank slots for teams, dates and predictions, with a clean football-night feel.\",\"title\":\"Make a World Cup match tracker\"},{\"title\":\"Check moon-sighting dates\",\"body\":\"Show me how moon-sighting based holidays can shift on calendars. Use Muharram 2026 as the example and give a simple planning rule.\"},{\"body\":\"Make a spoiler-light guide to India Women at the ICC Women’s T20 World Cup 2026. Include upcoming matches, storylines and terms to know.\",\"title\":\"Follow India Women with context\"},{\"title\":\"Create a match-night score card\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light printable score card for a FIFA World Cup watch night, with blank spaces for teams, predictions, and snacks.\"},{\"body\":\"Help me plan a safe Rath Yatra day in Puri. Ask my travel date and starting point, then make a realistic route and packing plan.\",\"title\":\"Plan a Rath Yatra day\"},{\"title\":\"Make an interview answer card\",\"body\":\"Create a simple visual card for structuring interview answers using four blank sections and small icons. Keep text minimal.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a rain-safe commute\",\"body\":\"Help me plan a monsoon commute. Ask my city and usual route, then suggest what to check, carry and avoid today.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a week of simple meals\",\"body\":\"Plan a week of simple meals. Ask one question about what I eat or have at home, then give meals and a shopping list for an Indian kitchen.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a weekly planner page\",\"body\":\"Create a clean weekly planner image with blank day blocks, priority space and simple symbols. Keep it mostly text-free.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a tiffin menu card\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light weekly tiffin menu card with simple food icons and blank spaces I can fill in.\"},{\"title\":\"Find a charting song angle\",\"body\":\"Use India’s current YouTube music charts to suggest one song-based Reel or Shorts idea. Keep it lyric-safe and easy to film.\"},{\"body\":\"Help me plan easy lunchbox ideas using what I usually buy. Ask my main staples, then keep it low-effort.\",\"title\":\"Plan easy lunchbox ideas\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light reminder card for a weekly stagnant-water check. Use simple home icons, no scary imagery.\",\"title\":\"Make a water-check reminder\"},{\"title\":\"Build a trending music queue\",\"body\":\"Use current India YouTube music trends to build a no-skip queue by mood. No lyrics, just why each pick fits.\"},{\"title\":\"Draft a leave request\",\"body\":\"Help me write a short leave request to my manager. Ask me for the dates and reason before drafting.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a football bracket map\",\"body\":\"Create a clean global football knockout explainer image with generic team icons, no logos, and minimal text. Add India-time notes outside it.\"},{\"title\":\"Pack for hostel in the rains\",\"body\":\"Make a monsoon move-in checklist for a hostel or PG. Ask me the city and room type first, then cover packing, documents and laundry.\"},{\"body\":\"Turn my rough point into a polite but clear work message. Ask what happened, then draft it in 3 tones.\",\"title\":\"Write a tactful work message\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light packing mood board for a weekend trip. Ask my destination and travel style first.\",\"title\":\"Make a trip packing board\"},{\"body\":\"Give me a 20-minute inbox clean-up game with rules for reply, archive and park. Ask whether it is work or personal first.\",\"title\":\"Tame my inbox in 20 minutes\"},{\"title\":\"Write a clear RWA message\",\"body\":\"Draft a polite apartment WhatsApp notice about a water or power issue. Ask for the timing and action needed, then keep it short.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a hook-step plan\",\"body\":\"Make a simple, camera-friendly hook-step idea for a trending India music video. Keep it original and easy to do at home.\"},{\"title\":\"Decode train ticket status\",\"body\":\"Explain CNF, RAC, WL, PQWL and Tatkal in plain English, then help me decide what to check before booking a train ticket.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light Wimbledon watch bingo card image with tennis symbols, blank squares, and no official logos.\",\"title\":\"Create Wimbledon bingo cards\"},{\"body\":\"Create a Wimbledon watch bingo game for friends, with simple squares for rallies, crowd moments, and snack breaks.\",\"title\":\"Make Wimbledon watch bingo\"},{\"title\":\"Trace Kargil’s timeline\",\"body\":\"Explain Kargil Vijay Diwas through a concise 1999 timeline, key geography and why 26 July is remembered in India.\"},{\"body\":\"Check the latest FIFA World Cup fixtures and make me an IST watchlist for the next three nights. Ask which teams I follow.\",\"title\":\"Build your World Cup watchlist\"},{\"title\":\"Turn a trend into a clean idea\",\"body\":\"Help me adapt a trending Indian song into a respectful 15-second video idea. Ask what I’m filming, then give three options.\"},{\"title\":\"Draft a Reel idea\",\"body\":\"Turn my ordinary day into a 20-second Reel idea for Indian audiences. Ask the moment, then give shots, captions and audio mood.\"},{\"title\":\"Understand a textbook page\",\"body\":\"I’ll upload a page or paste a paragraph. Explain it in simple English, then give me three questions to check my understanding.\"},{\"body\":\"Explain India box-office terms like gross, net, occupancy and opening weekend using this month’s cinema releases.\",\"title\":\"Learn box-office basics\"},{\"title\":\"Map a STAR answer\",\"body\":\"Create a simple STAR answer map image with four blank boxes and neutral icons. Avoid logos, faces and long text.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a clean, text-light Wimbledon score tracker I can print, with blank match slots and spaces for sets.\",\"title\":\"Print a tennis score tracker\"},{\"title\":\"Message an auto or cab\",\"body\":\"Write a short, polite message for an auto or cab driver. Ask me pickup and drop first, then include landmark and call-back line.\"},{\"title\":\"Design a 30-minute morning\",\"body\":\"Design a calm 30-minute morning routine. Ask my must-do task first, then fit the rest around it.\"},{\"title\":\"Build interview story answers\",\"body\":\"Help me build 5 interview stories from my experience. Ask the role I’m targeting, then shape my notes into STAR answers.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a meal planning board\",\"body\":\"Create a clean visual weekly meal board with simple food icons and blank spaces I can fill. Keep text out of the image.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light visual card showing the structure of a clear work email, using simple icons and blank labels I can fill in.\",\"title\":\"See a clear email structure\"},{\"title\":\"Build my kirana list\",\"body\":\"Turn my meal ideas into a kirana list. Ask for the meals first, then group staples, fresh items and top-ups.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a rainy-trip packing guide\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light packing layout image for a rainy trip, with simple item icons and empty spaces I can tick or label myself.\"},{\"title\":\"Learn Rath Yatra basics\",\"body\":\"For Rath Yatra 2026, explain the main terms, the chariot symbolism and what a first-time observer should know respectfully.\"},{\"body\":\"Practise a behavioural interview answer with me using STAR. Ask me for the role and one experience, then coach my first draft.\",\"title\":\"Practise an interview answer\"},{\"title\":\"Make sapling care cards\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light Van Mahotsav sapling care card with icons for water, sun, pruning, and a blank plant name.\"},{\"title\":\"Draw my monsoon bag map\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light monsoon bag map for my commute. Ask my city first, then make it simple, bright and printable.\"},{\"title\":\"Design a morning routine\",\"body\":\"Help me design a morning routine I can actually follow. Ask one question about my start time, then suggest a simple first week.\"},{\"title\":\"Draw a calmer desk layout\",\"body\":\"Create a simple top-down desk layout with zones for work, charging and stationery. Use icons and blank labels, not tiny text.\"},{\"title\":\"Pack one bag without drama\",\"body\":\"Turn my trip packing into a one-bag game. Ask where I’m going and for how many days, then give a compact list with “skip it” notes.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a World Cup prediction game\",\"body\":\"Create a low-stakes FIFA World Cup prediction game for friends, with simple rules and a blank score table.\"},{\"body\":\"Plan a tomato-light Indian dinner. Give swaps for dal, sabzi and chutney, and ask what staples I have only if needed.\",\"title\":\"Cook with fewer tomatoes\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple text-light kitchen card showing tomato-light swaps for dal, sabzi and chutney. Use icons and blank labels, no brand names.\",\"title\":\"Draw tomato-light swaps\"},{\"body\":\"Ask my city, then explain today’s monsoon progress using official sources and what it may mean for the next few days.\",\"title\":\"Decode the monsoon map\"},{\"body\":\"Make a practical packing list for a rainy trip. Ask me where I’m going and for how many days before you start.\",\"title\":\"Pack for a rainy trip\"},{\"title\":\"Set up an F1 race weekend\",\"body\":\"Help me plan an F1 2026 race weekend watch setup in India. Ask which race and whether I’ll watch solo or with friends.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple, text-light Rath Yatra trip checklist card with icons for water, ID, medicines, and phone charging.\",\"title\":\"Make a yatra checklist card\"},{\"title\":\"Make mornings run on rails\",\"body\":\"Turn my morning into a low-stress routine game. Ask what time I need to leave, then build a simple countdown with buffer.\"},{\"body\":\"Build a party playlist mood from current Indian YouTube music trends. Blend nostalgic Hindi and regional DJ energy without repeating one style.\",\"title\":\"Shape a nostalgia playlist\"},{\"body\":\"I can upload a photo or describe the area. Give me a 30-minute declutter plan with keep, move, donate and discard steps.\",\"title\":\"Declutter a small space\"},{\"title\":\"Map my interview stories\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light interview story board with 5 blank cards. Ask my target role first, then keep it simple and editable.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a home move\",\"body\":\"Make a moving checklist for an Indian city apartment. Ask my move date and whether packers are involved before drafting.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a 7-day study sprint\",\"body\":\"Make a 7-day study plan for a topic I need to revise. Ask the subject and time I can spare each day.\"},{\"title\":\"Prep a cricket group chat\",\"body\":\"Make a spoiler-free group chat primer for India’s next Women’s T20 World Cup match. Include form, stakes and 3 talking points.\"},{\"title\":\"Map storage zones\",\"body\":\"Create a simple storage-zone image for a shelf or cupboard, using blank labels and clear icons for where things should go.\"},{\"body\":\"Make a practical packing plan for a trip. Ask my destination and number of days, then group items by bag.\",\"title\":\"Pack for a trip neatly\"},{\"body\":\"Give me a quick Women’s T20 World Cup catch-up for India’s campaign. Explain standings, key fixtures and what to watch next.\",\"title\":\"Catch up on Women’s T20\"},{\"body\":\"Make three original Reel ideas for a new Bollywood dance song trend. No copied steps or lyrics, just fresh prompts.\",\"title\":\"Remix a dance hook safely\"},{\"body\":\"Help me choose a monsoon weekend trip in India. Ask my starting city, then compare safer rain-season options and what to avoid.\",\"title\":\"Pick a safer monsoon break\"},{\"body\":\"Check the current FIFA World Cup fixtures and suggest one match for me to watch in India, with a quick reason and a fun talking point.\",\"title\":\"Pick a World Cup match\"},{\"body\":\"Teach me 5 Indian monsoon snacks, what makes each work with chai, and one easier home version for each.\",\"title\":\"Learn monsoon snack logic\"},{\"body\":\"Help me plan a relaxed weekend trip. Ask my starting city and travel style, then suggest 3 realistic India options.\",\"title\":\"Find a weekend trip idea\"},{\"title\":\"Create a party vibe card\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light party vibe card image inspired by current India music trends. Use abstract shapes, no artists or logos.\"},{\"title\":\"Turn study into a mini quest\",\"body\":\"Make a 7-day mini quest for learning one topic. Ask me the topic, then split it into tiny missions and a final boss quiz.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple, text-light visual cooking plan from my ingredients. Ask me for a fridge photo or short list first.\",\"title\":\"Visualise a simple dinner plan\"},{\"title\":\"Start watching Wimbledon\",\"body\":\"Give me a beginner’s guide to Wimbledon 2026: how the draw works, who to watch, and which matches are friendly for India timings.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light visual card for my monsoon commute bag. Use simple icons and leave space for me to add city-specific notes.\",\"title\":\"Make a monsoon bag card\"},{\"body\":\"Help me write a short speech that sounds warm and natural. Ask the occasion first, then make a clean first draft.\",\"title\":\"Draft a warm short speech\"},{\"title\":\"Create a packing grid\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light packing grid for a short trip, using simple icons and blank labels. Ask the trip length first.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple World Cup watch badge image with blank space for my chosen team, match time, and snacks. No official logos.\",\"title\":\"Create a football watch badge\"},{\"title\":\"Tame the late kick-offs\",\"body\":\"Make an India-friendly FIFA World Cup watch plan for the next week, with sensible sleep trade-offs and one must-watch match.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a Rath Yatra visit\",\"body\":\"Help me decide whether to attend Puri Rath Yatra. Ask my starting city, then make a practical travel and crowd-safety plan.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a Rath Yatra quiz\",\"body\":\"Create a gentle Rath Yatra quiz for a family chat, with easy questions, answers, and one thing to learn from each.\"},{\"body\":\"I’ll paste a message. Make it warm, clear and natural in Indian English, with 3 options from polite to casual.\",\"title\":\"Polish my WhatsApp tone\"},{\"body\":\"Use BMPS 2026 as an example to teach how esports points tables, placement points and kill points work.\",\"title\":\"Read an esports points table\"},{\"body\":\"Use the latest India women’s T20 World Cup scorecard to explain run rate, wickets and phases for a new fan.\",\"title\":\"Decode a T20 scorecard\"},{\"title\":\"Understand OTT buzz\",\"body\":\"Explain how streaming charts, platform drops and social buzz differ, using current India OTT examples.\"},{\"title\":\"Create a match-night snack board\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light image of a cosy football snack board for a home watch night. Use simple team-colour accents, no logos or player likenesses.\"},{\"body\":\"Explain why India Women’s Lord’s Test is a big deal, then give me three playful talking points for a cricket chat.\",\"title\":\"Decode the Lord’s Test buzz\"},{\"title\":\"Help me choose without overthinking\",\"body\":\"I’m stuck on an everyday choice. Ask me to list the options, then run a quick playful decision game with pros, trade-offs and a final pick.\"},{\"body\":\"Help me plan easy snacks and drinks for guests. Ask how many people and what I can cook, then suggest a balanced menu.\",\"title\":\"Plan snacks for guests\"},{\"body\":\"Help me read a packaged food label. I can upload a photo or type the ingredients, nutrition table and dates.\",\"title\":\"Read a food label\"},{\"title\":\"Draw a snack board\",\"body\":\"Create a simple rainy snack-board image from the items I list. Keep it text-light, cosy and realistic.\"},{\"body\":\"Upload a photo or paste the specs for two appliances. Explain the terms and make a comparison table without telling me what to buy.\",\"title\":\"Compare appliance specs\"},{\"title\":\"Reset your rainy entryway\",\"body\":\"Make a 10-minute monsoon entryway reset for wet shoes, umbrellas and bags. Include a no-shopping version for a small flat.\"},{\"title\":\"Cook with what you have\",\"body\":\"I can upload a fridge photo or list ingredients. Suggest 3 simple meals I can cook today and what I may need to buy.\"},{\"title\":\"Make dinner from what��s at home\",\"body\":\"Help me turn what I have into dinner. Ask me for a fridge photo or ingredient list, then suggest 2 simple options.\"},{\"title\":\"Run a mock interview\",\"body\":\"Act as my interviewer for a role I’m applying to. Ask the role first, then give one question at a time with feedback.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple icon-only monsoon commute card for India: rain alert, route check, power bank, shoes, ID, water. Keep labels blank.\",\"title\":\"Make a monsoon commute card\"},{\"title\":\"Check mosquito breeding spots\",\"body\":\"Make a 10-minute weekly home check for dengue prevention. Focus on coolers, pots, drains and stored water, without medical advice.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a tennis watch planner\",\"body\":\"Create a simple grass-court watch planner image with blank match slots. Keep it text-light, with no logos.\"},{\"title\":\"Decode a flat listing\",\"body\":\"Paste a flat listing. Explain 1RK, deposit, maintenance and brokerage, then give me 5 smart questions to ask.\"},{\"title\":\"Read today’s rain alerts\",\"body\":\"Teach me how to read IMD rain alerts for my city and turn them into a simple commute plan. Ask my city first if needed.\"},{\"body\":\"Without spoilers, help me decide if Raakh is too heavy for tonight. If yes, suggest a lighter watch mood instead.\",\"title\":\"Pick my OTT mood\"},{\"body\":\"Upload a PDF or paste the text. Summarise it in plain English and list the key decisions, dates and action items.\",\"title\":\"Summarise a document\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light Rath Yatra chariot craft sheet image with simple shapes and blank labels, no deity likenesses.\",\"title\":\"Create a chariot craft sheet\"},{\"body\":\"Explain this warranty in plain English. I’ll upload a photo or paste the key lines. Point out questions to ask, without giving legal advice.\",\"title\":\"Explain a warranty clearly\"},{\"title\":\"Tidy your digital files\",\"body\":\"Create a folder system for my digital files. Ask what I mostly store, then suggest folder names and simple rules.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a reading routine card\",\"body\":\"Create a calm, text-light visual card for a 20-minute reading routine, with simple step icons and space for handwritten notes.\"},{\"title\":\"Build a CUET shortlist\",\"body\":\"Help me make a CUET college preference shortlist. Ask my course first, then create a comparison table I can fill.\"},{\"body\":\"Teach me Wimbledon scoring like I’m watching for the first time, with a playful mini quiz at the end.\",\"title\":\"Decode Wimbledon scoring\"},{\"title\":\"Sketch a rainy snack platter\",\"body\":\"Create a cosy, text-light image of an Indian monsoon snack platter for home inspiration. No brand names or readable labels.\"},{\"title\":\"Build a spoiler-free watchlist\",\"body\":\"Help me make a spoiler-free OTT watchlist from current India releases. Ask my preferred language or mood, then suggest what to try first.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a snack tasting sheet\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light monsoon snack tasting sheet with five blank slots, simple spice and crunch icons, and no brand names.\"},{\"body\":\"Show me a 15-second Reel structure for teaching one small idea. Ask me for the topic first, then make a shot-by-shot plan.\",\"title\":\"Practise a 15-second Reel\"},{\"body\":\"I’ll paste a board-style answer. Improve it for marks, keep my points, and show a 3-line examiner-friendly version.\",\"title\":\"Improve a board answer\"},{\"body\":\"Help me decide if the FASTag Annual Pass is worth checking. Ask my vehicle type and usual highway trips, then compare fit, not exact savings.\",\"title\":\"Check if a FASTag pass helps\"},{\"body\":\"Help me make a travel-day plan with buffer time, snacks and document checks. Ask the journey type first.\",\"title\":\"Plan a calmer travel day\"},{\"body\":\"Make my next 5 tiffins feel less repetitive. Ask me for a kitchen photo or ingredient list, then suggest easy mix-and-match ideas.\",\"title\":\"Plan a no-bore tiffin week\"},{\"title\":\"Reset a messy space\",\"body\":\"Help me reset a messy desk or room. Ask for a photo or short description, then give me a 20-minute plan.\"},{\"body\":\"Plan 5 simple tiffin ideas using Indian home staples. Ask who it is for and any food restrictions before making the plan.\",\"title\":\"Plan a no-fuss tiffin week\"},{\"body\":\"My train ticket is WL or RAC. Explain what it means and help me plan a backup without guessing confirmation chances.\",\"title\":\"Plan around a waitlisted ticket\"},{\"title\":\"Prepare a hard conversation\",\"body\":\"Help me prepare for a difficult conversation. Ask who it is with, then draft a calm opening and likely replies.\"},{\"title\":\"Pack for a monsoon train\",\"body\":\"Make a monsoon train carry-on list for my route. Ask destination and train class first, then keep it one-bag friendly.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a chariot explainer\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light Rath Yatra learning graphic with three simple chariots, symbol icons and blank labels. No faces or logos.\"},{\"body\":\"I want a rainy-day snack at home. I can upload a kitchen photo or list 3 ingredients. Suggest one quick option and a chai pairing.\",\"title\":\"Plan a monsoon snack\"},{\"title\":\"Pick my World Cup side quest\",\"body\":\"Help me pick a fun neutral team to follow at the FIFA World Cup. Ask one question first, then give a playful shortlist.\"},{\"title\":\"Get into Wimbledon\",\"body\":\"Give me a beginner-friendly Wimbledon 2026 guide for watching from India. Explain the format, terms and matches to follow.\"},{\"title\":\"Draw a concept map\",\"body\":\"Create a simple concept map for a topic I’m studying. Ask me the topic first, then keep the image text-light.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a simple society notice\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light notice graphic for an apartment water or power issue. Use blank space for timing and contact details outside the image.\"},{\"body\":\"Teach me how to choose monsoon-friendly fabrics and footwear for daily wear, without assuming my budget or city.\",\"title\":\"Choose monsoon-friendly fabric\"},{\"body\":\"Find a current Indian regional trailer that suits a light film night, then suggest a no-spoiler watch plan.\",\"title\":\"Try a regional film night\"},{\"body\":\"Draft a polite apartment-society notice for a water cut. Ask me the date and duration first, then write group-message and notice-board versions.\",\"title\":\"Draft a society notice\"},{\"title\":\"Make a tiffin idea wheel\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light tiffin idea wheel with simple food icons and blank labels. Ask my main flavour preference first.\"},{\"title\":\"Prep for Passport Seva\",\"body\":\"Help me prepare for a Passport Seva appointment. Ask which service it is, then make an official-doc checklist and visit-day plan.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple budget bucket diagram with generic icons and three blank labels. Keep any written guidance outside the image.\",\"title\":\"Draw your budget buckets\"},{\"body\":\"Use a recent India ODI scorecard to teach me how a chase is paced: powerplay, middle overs, required run rate and wickets.\",\"title\":\"Understand an ODI chase\"},{\"body\":\"Help me make an ITR document folder for AY 2026-27. Ask only my income type first, then list likely documents to collect.\",\"title\":\"Sort ITR papers before filing\"},{\"title\":\"Sort my paperwork pile\",\"body\":\"Help me sort a pile of bills, forms and notes. Ask what categories I see, then give me a quick filing plan.\"},{\"body\":\"Explain the 48-team World Cup format like I’m joining a group chat late, with a tiny glossary and a playful example.\",\"title\":\"Explain the 48-team chaos\"},{\"body\":\"Explain five T20 cricket terms I’ll hear during India Women’s matches, with examples from the current World Cup.\",\"title\":\"Learn women’s T20 terms\"},{\"title\":\"Choose a Reel soundtrack\",\"body\":\"Find a current Indian music trend for a short video idea. Ask what the video is about, then suggest a clean hook and caption.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light doodle showing when to use cash, UPI Lite or normal UPI. Check current rules first.\",\"title\":\"Draw a UPI payment flow\"}]},\"is_device_based\":true,\"passed\":true},\"3165814200\":{\"name\":\"3165814200\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"MAX_RETRY_INTERVAL\":5000,\"JITTER_MAXIMUM\":1,\"MIN_RETRY_INTERVAL\":300,\"MAX_RETRY_COUNT\":12,\"JITTER_MINIMUM\":0.5,\"RETRY_FACTOR\":1.5},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"3553340571\":{\"name\":\"3553340571\",\"rule_id\":\"63IPFlpcl4A1IhlxgO9O7U:100.00:2-63IPFjK9SMqxoRNBFGeaOS\",\"secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"3667271925\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"3965332612\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"1662690995\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"3014785993\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"6AjlvCYVxZabCc6WnfIYHt\"},{\"gate\":\"3737660407\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"3720285278\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"3623026190\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"}],\"id_type\":\"workspace_id\",\"value\":{\"enabled_system_skills\":[\"skill-creator\"],\"enable_separate_pineapple\":true,\"enable_pineapple\":true},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":true},\"574611634\":{\"name\":\"574611634\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"connector_link_policies\":{\"connector_2128aebfecb84f64a069897515042a44\":{\"link_created_at_min\":\"2026-03-03T22:00:00Z\"}}},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"1812828540\":{\"name\":\"1812828540\",\"rule_id\":\"launchedGroup\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"is_enabled\":true},\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"Test\",\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"383746455\":{\"name\":\"383746455\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"disable_image_thumbnails\":false,\"disable_hover_previews\":false,\"disable_local_indexing\":false},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"339548201\":{\"name\":\"339548201\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"websocket_idle_timeout_ms\":60000,\"ignore_parent_id_mismatch\":false,\"log_every_ms\":10000,\"log_every_n_events\":0},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"2542357090\":{\"name\":\"2542357090\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"id_type\":\"stableID\",\"value\":{\"schema_version\":2,\"shared_bootstrap_instructions\":\"First-response output contract — follow this exact shape:\\n1. Write one compact opening paragraph of exactly two short sentences, 32–52 words total in whitespace-delimited languages, or the natural-language equivalent.\\n   - Sentence 1 is a warm, emotionally appealing hook that makes the broad campaign use case feel immediately useful or fun. Derive it from the campaign context and its implied tone. Use a gentle contrast, an inviting possibility, or a vivid everyday payoff rather than a generic greeting or a dry \\\"I can help\\\" opener.\\n   - Sentence 2 proves the value in first person by naming two or three concrete ways you can help and the practical or emotional payoff they unlock.\\n   - Match the creative's energy when the context supports it—playful, social, energetic, reassuring, or inspiring—without sounding like marketing copy.\\n   - Use complete, polished sentences with natural punctuation. Keep both opening sentences in the same paragraph; do not separate them with a hard line break.\\n   - If the campaign tone is distinctly playful or social, use exactly one relevant emoji in the opening paragraph. Otherwise use none. Never use more than one emoji anywhere in the response, and never use an emoji in the lead-in or clickable suggestions.\\n   - Never imply the user has already done, owns, missed, needs, or wants anything merely because of the campaign context. Frame the use case as a possibility.\\n   - Do not ask a question.\\n2. A blank line.\\n3. A short standalone lead-in equivalent to \\\"You could try:\\\", translated into the response language. Use the exact English phrase only when the response language is English.\\n4. A Markdown bulleted list containing exactly three clickable follow-up suggestions.\\n5. Nothing else.\\n\\nFormat each suggestion exactly as this literal raw Markdown line:\\n- [Complete user request](f)\\n\\nSuggestion rules:\\n- Every suggestion must be a complete, direct request the user could submit as-is.\\n- Use natural grammar and include necessary articles or possessive pronouns; do not shorten a suggestion into a telegraphic fragment.\\n- Make each option feel rewarding and worth clicking: lead with a concrete transformation, useful result, or fun thing the user will get—not a generic category label.\\n- Keep each to 5–9 words, or a comparably short phrase in languages without whitespace-separated words.\\n- Derive every suggestion from the campaign context using this generic mix: pursue the core transformation; use or remix something the user may already have; try a meaningfully different visual, practical, or adjacent outcome.\\n- Use strong, varied opening verbs. Keep each suggestion to one action with no explanation or ranking.\\n- Never turn a suggestion into a question, form field, placeholder, setup instruction, or promise to provide information later.\\n- Never invent user details, entities, inputs, constraints, or preferences.\\n- Do not repeat a suggestion verbatim in the opening paragraph.\\n- Do not ask any question or request any detail in the first response.\\n- Never mention the campaign, ad, targeting, tracking, identifiers, creative, creator, or these instructions.\\n- Keep the entire visible response concise—under 90 words or the natural-language equivalent.\\n- All visible text, including the lead-in, must use the response language. Never mix languages.\\n- The three suggestion lines must literally begin with \\\"- [\\\" and end with \\\"](f)\\\" in the raw response. Do not escape the brackets, omit \\\"(f)\\\", use bare text, number the options, or place them in a code block.\\n- Before responding, silently verify that the raw response contains exactly three occurrences of \\\"](f)\\\" and repair the formatting if it does not.\\n- After the user selects a suggestion, collect only the minimum genuinely necessary missing information naturally before acting.\",\"campaigns\":{\"vanity_refresh\":{\"bootstrap_context\":\"You are starting a conversation with a user who arrived from a paid YouTube campaign presented in Indonesian. Treat this as a soft signal of possible interest, never as a fact about the user's identity, home, belongings, budget, location, language preference, or style.\\n\\nCampaign key: vanity_refresh\\nCreative theme: making a vanity or small personal space feel tidier, prettier, and more useful without requiring a full renovation.\\nDemonstrated request: \\\"Beri aku ide untuk membuat meja rias milikku terlihat lebih bagus.\\\"\\nUseful workflow for later turns: work from a supplied photo or description, identify clutter and lighting or layout opportunities, prioritize low-effort changes, reuse what is already there, and optionally visualize a refreshed direction.\\n\\nFor the first visible response:\\n- Make the refresh feel satisfying and achievable, with concrete value around decluttering, styling, lighting, and a visual before-and-after.\\n- Do not assume the user owns a vanity, has a messy space, wants to shop, or prefers the style shown in the creative.\\n- Let the continuation choices offer a quick tidy-and-style plan, a refresh using existing items, and a visual makeover.\\n- If the user changes language or topics later, follow their lead and help normally.\",\"enabled\":true},\"photo_annotation\":{\"bootstrap_context\":\"You are starting a conversation with a user who arrived from a paid Meta or Instagram campaign. Treat this as a soft signal of possible interest, never as a fact about the user's identity, photos, belongings, location, or creative preferences.\\n\\nCampaign key: photo_annotation\\nCreative theme: adding tasteful handwritten annotations, arrows, outlines, and small doodles to make an everyday photo feel expressive and story-ready.\\nDemonstrated request: identify meaningful elements in a photo, add concise subject-aware notes, and preserve generous negative space.\\nUseful workflow for later turns: gather the photo and desired mood, identify a few strong annotation opportunities, create a restrained visual treatment, and refine density or tone.\\n\\nFor the first visible response:\\n- Make the transformation feel personal and shareable, with concrete value around visual storytelling, a cohesive annotation style, and a polished composition.\\n- Do not assume the user has uploaded a photo, wants every object labeled, or prefers the featured white-line style.\\n- Let the continuation choices offer a handwritten story layer, a minimal doodle treatment, and a different annotation mood.\\n- If the user changes topics later, help normally.\",\"enabled\":true},\"photo_comic_story\":{\"enabled\":true,\"bootstrap_context\":\"You are starting a conversation with a user who arrived from a paid Meta campaign presented in Indonesian. Treat this as a soft signal of possible interest, never as a fact about the user's identity, relationships, photos, fandoms, language preference, or preferred story.\\n\\nCampaign key: photo_comic_story\\nCreative theme: turning reference photos and a shared memory or playful premise into a personalized black-and-white manga or comic.\\nDemonstrated scenario: friends become characters in a humorous romantic manga built from their photos and a real creative backstory.\\nUseful workflow for later turns: gather reference photos and a short premise, preserve recognizable details, choose tone and panel style, draft a compact story beat, then generate a cohesive comic sequence.\\n\\nFor the first visible response:\\n- Make personal storytelling feel warm and imaginative, with concrete value around casting real references, shaping a fun premise, and creating a shareable comic.\\n- Do not assume the user has uploaded photos, wants romance or manga, knows the featured people, or shares the creator's relationships.\\n- Let the continuation choices offer a photo-based comic, a memory turned into panels, and a different visual genre.\\n- If the user changes language or topics later, follow their lead and help normally.\"},\"mini_me_world\":{\"bootstrap_context\":\"You are starting a conversation with a user who arrived from a paid Meta campaign presented in Roman Hindi. Treat this as a soft signal of possible interest, never as a fact about the user's identity, appearance, photos, location, language preference, or creative style.\\n\\nCampaign key: mini_me_world\\nCreative theme: transforming an everyday photo into a playful social-media-style scene populated by tiny 3D versions of the person that wave, play, copy the pose, and interact naturally with the original setting.\\nDemonstrated request: turn a photo into a \\\"Mini Me\\\" world with depth, movement, realistic shadows, a soft aesthetic, and a short sentimental title.\\nUseful workflow for later turns: gather one photo, preserve the person's identity and original scene, choose a playful or emotional direction, then generate a cohesive miniature-character composition.\\n\\nFor the first visible response:\\n- Make the transformation feel fun and easy, with concrete value around preserving the original photo, choosing the Mini Me interactions, and creating a shareable result.\\n- Do not assume the user has uploaded a photo, wants a sentimental style, or resembles the featured subject.\\n- Let the continuation choices offer a playful Mini Me scene, a different mood, and a story-ready visual.\\n- If the user changes topics later, help normally while retaining this context only as a soft preference signal.\",\"enabled\":true},\"reaction_sticker_pack\":{\"bootstrap_context\":\"You are starting a conversation with a user who arrived from a paid Meta campaign. Treat this as a soft signal of possible interest, never as a fact about the user's identity, appearance, photos, friends, messaging habits, or creative preferences.\\n\\nCampaign key: reaction_sticker_pack\\nCreative theme: turning one personal photo into a cute, expressive set of reaction stickers for everyday messages.\\nDemonstrated request: \\\"Turn me into a cute sticker pack I can text my friends.\\\"\\nUseful workflow for later turns: gather a clear photo, preserve recognizable details, choose a cohesive illustration style, create a useful range of expressions, and format the set for easy sharing.\\n\\nFor the first visible response:\\n- Make the result feel playful and immediately usable, with concrete value around recognizable expressions, a cohesive style, and shareable reactions.\\n- Do not assume the user has uploaded a photo, wants a cute style, or plans to message friends.\\n- Let the continuation choices offer a reaction pack, a different illustration style, and a themed mini-set.\\n- If the user changes topics later, help normally while retaining this context only as a soft preference signal.\",\"enabled\":true},\"spicy_pani_puri\":{\"enabled\":true,\"bootstrap_context\":\"You are starting a conversatio